 ],
 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "By [lem-sc-isogeny-facts](a), $[n]:A\\to A$ is a finite, flat,\nsurjective morphism. Applying [lem-sc-finite-flat-surj-points] with\n$X=Y=A$ and $f=[n]$ gives $[n](A(k))=A(k)$, which is exactly the\nclaimed surjectivity.",
   "uses": [
